      The same tab click, four blast radii. Approaches 1 and 2 swap a route segment beneath a
      persistent layout (2 additionally never repaints the bar); Approach 3 confines the swap to one
      slot while sibling regions hold their state; Approach 4 re-renders the whole page segment, and
      is the only row where the panel loses per-tab splitting, loading/error files, and prefetching.
